==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*5 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Heavyweight]] is a must to stop the zombies from burrowing, and [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener Cat]] can deal lots of damage to the Zories and Zang Roos. Even on a low magnification, they are still deadly. The One Horns and Sir Seals pose little of a threat in this stage.

